  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Union Commission, peace &amp; Secu programme Africa Union Commission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of this programme is to contribute to a more peaceful Africa through supporting peace objectives stated under the African Union Medium Term Plan and Agenda 2063. This grant, via a Joint Funding Arrangement, will contribute to operational and activity costs of the African Union Peace and Security  (AUCPAPS) work for 2021. This will enable PAPS to support and coordinate activities related to conflict prevention, conflict management and resolution, post-conflict reconstruction and peace-building efforts in the African Continent.</narrative>
  </description>
